<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Aspect cut by Goldman.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Aspect cut by Goldman.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Goldman Sachs said it downgraded Aspect Telecommunications Corp to market perform from market outperform.</p>
<p>-- Additional details were not immediately available.</p>
<p>-- Late on Wednesday, Aspect posted second quarter earnings of $0.24 per primary share compared to $0.18 a share a year ago. Revenues rose about 28 percent to $93.5 million.</p>
<p>-- Aspect lost 6 to 20-1/4.</p>
</text>
